                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Dendrochronological research project by D.J. de Vries and H. Tisje. Digitization of the analog measurement series: Benno Ridderhof (VU, 2008); further additions and reformatting: Esther Jansma (2011). \nogical research project"
                }
